DeepSeek V4.1's DSML tool calls: the parsing part of upstream 74bca3950 ("model: DSV4.1 flash (#31086)"),
as llama.cpp v0.9.0 (cd959bae) has it:
- common/chat.cpp:1373-1383 recognizes a template that writes "｜DSML｜ calls>";
- common/parsers/deepseek.cpp:79-80 sets is_v41, and :136-143 spells its tag names with a leading space
  and its call block "calls" (the checkpoint's encoding/encoding.py:428-430).
The commit's other V4.1 parts are not ported: tools declared on system messages, the reasoning-effort
mapping, the bare </think> of a continuation, and render_message_to_json_deepseek_v4_1. The extraction's
requests carry none of those.
